==English==

===Etymology===
From [[trial]] + [[ware]] a contraction of [[software]]
Trialware is a combination of [[freeware]] and [[shareware]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}
# {{context|Internet}} Software that can be [[try|tried]] for a limited time, after which it expires or has limited functionality.

